+# Final review: cluster 5 (inspect), epic hg-blw
+
+Source: base bfeb8f3104dd3783d67a46570c9f272e935012b5, head 2dfa656c7f98715fe66ca53c253de19f369a857d. I verified both with `git rev-parse --verify <sha>^{commit}`. The bind-review-source command exited 0. The caller checkout was at HEAD 2dfa656 with a clean status when I started and when I finished. Nothing was switched or restored.
+
+Inputs: slices 000047-000057 (src/inspect/{fixture,harness_files,inventory,loaded,log,mod,output,roster,scope,sessions,stack}.rs), digest.md, `bd show hg-blw`, and the design doc docs/superpowers/runs/2026-11-07-graph-state-inspection/2026-11-07-graph-state-inspection-design.md (Requirement baseline, sections 2.1-2.6). I read these only to check named risks: src/cli/seat.rs (the hook writer), src/bootstrap/instructions.rs `fit_hook`, src/bootstrap/setup_claude.rs (hook command strings), src/observe/sessions.rs, src/observe/matcher.rs, src/herdr/wire.rs and src/herdr/tests.rs (the Codex occupant id form), and the earlier invocation's cluster-5 review.
